      <title>实测显示AI写高考作文稳定48-56分，已超八成考生</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/edudaily/post/20260902/%E5%AE%9E%E6%B5%8B%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BAAI%E5%86%99%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E4%BD%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%B3%E5%AE%9A48-56%E5%88%86%E5%B7%B2%E8%B6%85%E5%85%AB%E6%88%90%E8%80%83%E7%94%9F/</link>
